@startuml
title Sequence Diagram 2: Organizer Cancels an Event (F2)
autonumber
actor "Organizer" as P0
participant "React UI" as P1
participant "Event API" as P2
participant "Event Service" as P3
participant "Registration Service" as P4
participant "Notification Service" as P5
participant "Database" as P6
participant "Audit Logger" as P7
P0 -> P1 : Click Cancel Event
P1 -> P2 : POST /api/events/:id/cancel
P2 -> P3 : cancelEvent(eventId, organizerId)
P3 -> P6 : Load event
P6 --> P3 : Event record
alt organizer owns the event and it is not cancelled
P3 -> P6 : Set status CANCELLED
P3 -> P7 : Log EVENT_CANCELLED
P3 -> P4 : cancelAllRegistrations(eventId)
P4 -> P6 : Set registrations CANCELLED
P4 -> P5 : Notify attendees: event cancelled
P5 -> P6 : Save in-app notifications
P3 --> P2 : Cancellation result
P2 --> P1 : 200 {status: CANCELLED}
else not the owner or already cancelled
P2 --> P1 : 403 Forbidden / 409 Conflict
end
@enduml
